  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adopting climate-resilient practices in the agricultural sector, as well as preventing and reducing food loss and waste in Azerbaijan, to promote GHG emissions mitigation, resilience, food and nutrition security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the Government of Azerbaijan in reducing food loss and waste, contributing to the transition toward sustainable agrifood systems. These efforts will promote more efficient use of natural resources, reduce environmental impacts, and enhance food security and nutrition. The project will strengthen institutional and policy frameworks, support capacity building and awareness-raising, facilitate data collection on food loss and waste, and pilot climate-resilient technologies.</narrative>
  </description>
